  "text": "ZOI\nPhotos\nMy stay\nContact\n\nCORFU · STAY A LITTLE LONGER\n\nCorfu Mare Boutique Hotel\n\nCorfu Mare Boutique Hotel, a member of “Eco Hotels of the World”, is an Adults Only Hotel built in an ideally-located suburb of Corfu Town.\n\nPlan your stay\n\nPhotograph temporarily unavailable.\n\nA closer look\n\nPhoto temporarily unavailable\n\nPhoto temporarily unavailable\n\nPhoto temporarily unavailable\n\nPhoto temporarily unavailable\n\nPhoto temporarily unavailable\n\nPhoto temporarily unavailable\n\nMAKE IT YOUR KIND OF STAY\n\nMake your stay happen.\n\nBooking through the hotel’s provider\n\nChoose your dates and guests, then contact the hotel about your stay. Your plan stays on this device until you choose to share it.\n\nArrival\nDeparture\nGuests\nFind my next step →\nCopy enquiry\n\nSee you in Corfu\n\nNikolaou Zervou 5, Kefalomantouko, Corfu\n\nCall the hotel\nEmail the hotel\nOfficial website ↗\nFacebook ↗\n\nManage this hotel’s booking setup\n\nAbout this information\nCorfu Mare Boutique Hotel · Discover your next place on Zoi",
